  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam - Food Safety phaseII</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strategic Sector Cooperation on Food Safety in Vietnam aims to contribute to framework conditions that support Food Safety and safety in the Vietnamese pork value chain by:

-Improving legal framework and practices in the areas of  feed management, prescription of veterinary drugs, and use of antimicrobials;
-Increasing capacity of government officials in the area of risk-based food safety management and control.</narrative>
  </description>
