  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved framework conditions for sustainable development</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="269654" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSC contributions in 2019 to framework conditions within food safety in Vietnam: &quot;4 &quot;.

Score from 1-5, 1 lowest and 5 highest.

The planned output targets in the project have been met in 2019.

The project has had substantial and direct influence on the development of the legal
framework for feed management and veterinary drug management in Vietnam. In 2019, the SSC-partners worked closely together on the development of legislation to implement the feed management chapter in the 2018 Animal Husbandry Law. In addition, the SSC partners cooperated on the further development of the Circular on Prescription of veterinary medicine, and preparations were made for an impact analysis of the planned legislative changes to map the expected impact of the new law on public and private stakeholders.</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2019-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2019-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="5"></target>
     <actual value="4"></actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
